. ເຈົ້າພຽງແຕ່ຈະລ້າງທາງເດີນທາງແລະຂີ້ຝຸ່ນ.

123
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:35,050
[DELANEY]
That's Jerry Kimble. He was convicted of stabbing a young mother forty-nine times in front of her two year-old son, then killing and sexually assaulting a woman before smothering her four-year-old daughter. They call him the Green Chain Rapist. He was in Sing Sing but was certified insane and his lawyer got him transferred here. He doesn't make any noise or fuss, but he is a dangerous man. Especially towards women. This next inmate is even worse. Delaney slides the hatch shut and walks over to the next door. He slowly slides open the hatch and Lisa peers inside. Another basic white cell with only a bed and toilet. A man stands in the centre of the room with his hands behind his back. His hair is slicked back, as jet black as the eyes that stare at Lisa. He smiles. Delaney slides the hatch shut.
ນັ້ນແມ່ນເຈຣີ ຄິມບລ. ລາວຖືກຕັດສິນໂທດວ່າໄດ້ດອກແມ່ຫນຸ່ມສີ່ສິບເກົ້າຄັ້ງຕໍ່ຫນ້າລູກຊາຍອາຍຸສອງປີ, ຫຼັງຈາກນັ້ນຂ້າແລະໂຈມຕີທາງເພດແມ່ຍິງກ່ອນທີ່ຈະບິດລູກສາວອາຍຸສີ່ປີ.
ພວກເຂົາເອີ້ນລາວວ່າຜູ້ຂົ່ມຂືນຕ່ອງໂສ້ສີຂຽວ. ລາວຢູ່ໃນຊິງຊິງແຕ່ໄດ້ຮັບການຢັ້ງຢືນວ່າໂຊກຮ້າຍແລະທະນາຍຄວາມຂອງລາວໄດ້ສົ່ງລາວມາບ່ອນນີ້. ລາວບໍ່ເຮັດໃຫ້ສຽງດັງຫຼືຄວາມວຸ້ນວາຍໃດໆ, ແຕ່ລາວເປັນຜູ້ຊາຍອັນຕະລ

124
